Url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aJcDVCodnUGa?from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667493707461020968","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667493707461020968","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"搜狐","url":"https://m.sohu.com/a/1063942281_121886306","normalizedUrl":"https://m.sohu.com/a/1063942281_121886306","domain":"m.sohu.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7664907261168324287","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7664907261168324287","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"千川“标准推广”5月下线!3步破解流量生死局 - 零售 - 亿邦动力","url":"https://m.ebrun.com/578944.html","normalizedUrl":"https://m.ebrun.com/578944.html","domain":"m.ebrun.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7544311342484819240","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7544311342484819240","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"CMCR-CMP-20260819-C3-Q0025","q":"CMCR-Q0025","question":"千川隐藏素材在哪里看？","day":1,"repeat":3,"valid":true,"answer":"# 千川隐藏素材查看\n>千川“隐藏素材”=千川后台**本地上传投放、不发布到抖音主页**的视频，抖音主页看不到，但千川账户内可使用；**千川官方后台没有专门叫“隐藏素材”的独立筛选标签**。\n\n## 一、看自己账户的隐藏素材（官方PC后台）\n1. 登录千川PC后台qianchuan.jinritemai.com\n2. **工具 → 创意管理 → 视频库**\n3. 筛选【素材来源】选择**本地上传**\n👉这里全部就是你千川后台上传、不一定同步抖音主页的素材（也就是常说的自己账号隐藏投放素材），可以预览、下载、复用。\n\n>注意：\n- “主页是否隐藏”是上传创意时的投放属性，视频库不单独标记该字段；只要是本地上传来源，就支持设置主页隐藏不对外展示。\n- 抖音主页发出来的公开挂车视频，来源是【抖音主页】，不在本地上传分组。\n\n## 二、看竞品/别人账号的千川隐藏素材\n**千川官方后台不提供查看别人隐藏素材的能力**，竞品本地上传、主页不显示的广告素材，原生后台无法直接调取查看。\n市面上蝉妈妈、有米云等第三方付费工具，可以抓取公开广告流量中曝光过的千川素材，识别出主页没有对应作品的广告物料，但不属于巨量官方功能，数据会存在漏抓、延迟，仅供参考，注意版权风险。\n\n## 三、容易混淆的两类“看不见”素材\n1. **被排除的智选素材（全域计划）**\n路径：编辑全域计划 → 排除抖音主页视频，这里是计划内屏蔽不投放，素材本身还在素材库/抖音主页，不是真正隐藏素材。\n2. **审核拒绝/过滤素材**\n视频库筛选审核状态，查看被拒素材，和主页隐藏不是一回事。\n\n## 四、遇到找不到素材，咨询官方客服\n千川PC端右下角【智投星】；抖音APP：我→右上角三横线→更多功能→小店随心推→我的→帮助与客服。\n\n如果你需要，我可以帮你整理一份千川视频库排查素材找不到的快速自查清单。","answerHash":"98aacbe64eeb1aa5258d2e9aab6013de094cf5d41eff41a01d03c4a42d1cd353","finishedAt":"2026-08-18","replacement":false,"brands":["蝉妈妈"],"sources":[{"title":"如何看千川隐藏素材? - 自媒体问答 - HCRM问答","url":"https://bbs.huochengrm.cn/questions/21098.html","normalizedUrl":"https://bbs.huochengrm.cn/questions/21098.html","domain":"bbs.huochengrm.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7658224428979875066","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7658224428979875066","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音电商","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8APt?from=douyinofficial_table%2F1000&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8APt?from=douyinofficial_table%2F1000&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7654157362026089780","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7654157362026089780","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音巨量千川平台更新低质量内容治理策略 - 多面手企业网络推广一站式服务","url":"https://80tg.com/news/43430.html","normalizedUrl":"https://80tg.com/news/43430.html","domain":"80tg.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音电商","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8L8r?from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8L8r?from_school=1&shou